# Demo layout standards

## Panel inset

Use `PANEL_INSET_STANDARD_PX` (24px) for horizontal padding on the glass panel.
Apply symmetrically via `PANEL_INSET_END_PX` in `src/lib/demoLayout.ts`.

## Section spacing

Use `FEATURE_SECTION_GAP_STANDARD_PX` (24px) above the glass panel via `FEATURE_SECTION_GAP_PX`.

## Reveal hints

Hint text must use `CURSOR_MUTED_TEXT` from `demoTheme.ts`, not `PAGE_BACKGROUND`.

## Hero mark

Set `SHOW_HERO_MARK` to `false` in `demoTheme.ts` when the hero image should be removed.
